    "created_at": "2020-04-15T07:51:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-04-15T07:51:29Z",
    "body": "To be clear, I'd consider expensive operations to be effectively blocking and not desirable on web platform [[CanBlock]] is false agents. It means you might end up skipping a frame, not encode some audio in time, not process requests in a timely manner, etc.",
